
== 1. A stolen key: one request every 2 seconds for an hour ============
normal user: ~10 requests/hour, 1,500 tokens in, 400 out ($0.11/hour)
config               tok in  served  spent    notes                     
-------------------  ------  ------  -------  --------------------------
no limits            30,000  1800    $270.00  -                         
alert at $25         30,000  1800    $270.00  alert fired at request 167
hard cap $25         30,000  166     $24.90   hard cap x1634            
all limits           30,000  0       $0.00    input too large x1800     
all limits, adapted  7,900   300     $11.61   tokens/minute x1500       
'adapted' = the attacker shrinks requests to slip under the input limit.

